        <section class="r154-training-section r154-training-section-alt" id="choose-course" aria-labelledby="choose-course-title">

            <div class="r154-training-section-heading">

                <span class="r154-training-eyebrow">
                    Select the Course That Matches Your Goal
                </span>

                <h2 class="r154-training-section-title" id="choose-course-title">
                    Which Referee Course Should I Take?
                </h2>

            </div>


            <div class="r154-training-course-grid">

                <article class="r154-training-course-card">

                    <div class="r154-training-course-header">

                        <span class="r154-training-course-label">
                            New Referee Option 1
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Regional Referee Full In-Person
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <div class="r154-training-course-body">

                        <p>
                            Complete the entry-level instruction during one
                            approved full-day course that combines classroom
                            learning and practical referee activities.
                        </p>

                        <div class="r154-training-action-list">

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Intended for new adult and youth referees.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Online Regional Referee coursework is not
                                required when taking the complete full-day
                                course.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Attend the entire scheduled course.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Complete the required examination or assessment.
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="r154-training-course-best">
                            Best for volunteers who prefer to complete their
                            primary instruction during one in-person day.
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-training-course-card">

                    <div class="r154-training-course-header">

                        <span class="r154-training-course-label">
                            New Referee Option 2
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Online Course Plus Companion Field Day
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <div class="r154-training-course-body">

                        <p>
                            Complete the Regional Referee online course first,
                            then attend an approved in-person Companion Course
                            or Field Day.
                        </p>

                        <div class="r154-training-action-list">

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Complete the Regional Referee online modules.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Complete the online examination.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Enroll separately in the Companion Field Day.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Attend the complete practical session.
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="r154-training-course-best">
                            Best for volunteers who prefer to complete classroom
                            material independently before field instruction.
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </article>


                <article class="r154-training-course-card">

                    <div class="r154-training-course-header">

                        <span class="r154-training-course-label">
                            Current Regional Referees
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Intermediate Referee Course
                        </h3>

                    </div>

                    <div class="r154-training-course-body">

                        <p>
                            The Intermediate course is an AYSO badge-upgrade
                            course for current Regional Referees developing
                            skills for more demanding matches.
                        </p>

                        <div class="r154-training-action-list">

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Regional Referee certification is required.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Review advancement requirements before
                                enrolling.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Confirm required match experience.
                            </div>

                            <div class="r154-training-action-row">
                                Coordinate your upgrade plan with the RRA.
                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="r154-training-course-best">
                            Best for experienced Regional Referees who are ready
                            to begin a formal badge upgrade.
                        </div>

                    </div>

                </article>

            </div>


            <div class="r154-training-course-warning">

                <strong>
                    Region 154’s standard entry course is Regional Referee.
                </strong>

                Do not enroll in an 8U Official course or an upgrade course
                unless the Regional Referee Administrator has instructed you
                to do so.

